11.During the listing and auction periods, you can Pre-purchase or bid on multiple Auction House items at once;
22.When the auction officially begins, Pre-purchase searches all listings for the lowest-priced batch of items and initiates batch Auto-Bid;
33.The full Pre-purchase price will be deducted from your Currency upfront. If canceled or outbid, the Currency will be returned by mail;
44.Because Pre-purchase searches for the lowest-priced listings available, you may initiate Auto-Bid on the same item as another player. Please keep this in mind.
